<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>个人介绍</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }
        .wrap {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.65);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 36px 28px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #93c5fd;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .sub-title {
            text-align: center;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .item {
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }
        .item h3 {
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .item p {
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }
        .tag-box {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .tag {
            background-color: #2563eb33;
            color: #93c5fd;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 99px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .footer-tip {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="card">
            <h1>任喆</h1>
            <div class="sub-title">软件技术专业学生</div>

            <div class="item">
                <h3>📌 关于我</h3>
                <p>喜欢编程、折腾AI工具、写文稿，平时会看球赛、构思OC和故事，热衷于动手做各类小项目。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <h3>📚 学习方向</h3>
                <p>主修软件技术，自学Python、网页开发，尝试搭建AI Agent，开发自动化小工具、整理学习笔记。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <h3>✨ 技能标签</h3>
                <div class="tag-box">
                    <span class="tag">Python</span>
                    <span class="tag">AI Agent</span>
                    <span class="tag">HTML</span>
                    <span class="tag">网页制作</span>
                    <span class="tag">ACGN创作</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <h3>🎯 目标</h3>
                <p>持续敲代码、做实战项目，打磨开发能力，把想法变成可以运行的程序。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-tip">
                欢迎访问我的个人页面
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
